Recommends: yad
Description: wine-bleeding runtime dispatcher and tooling
 wine-bleeding-wb provides the wb runtime dispatcher, wb-diag diagnostic
 helper, shell library modules (wb-lib), hook infrastructure, configuration
 schemas, and supporting tooling for managing Wine prefixes and Wine runtime
 distributions.
 .
 Includes full system integration: desktop entry, icon, and Steam
 compatibility tool support (when GUI files are present).
